CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'req_params->api_max < req_params->api_min'
#379: FILE: drivers/base/firmware_class.c:1837:
+	if (!req_params->api_max ||
+	    (req_params->api_max < req_params->api_min) ||
+	    (driver_data_async_cb(req_params)) ||
+	    (!driver_data_async_api_cb(req_params)))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

